{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice of Kalma is a  deckbuilding roguelike where you play dice against Kalma, the grim guardian of the Underworld. Build a deck of powerful skulls, find synergies, and turn the dice to your favor to escape back to the world of the living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience  the first full 10 levels of the game. Try out different synergies while building your deck. Replay with a different deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/e0a6db2ab1b758e0ce3e3fc960d9d104.poster.avif?t=1759311804\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/e0a6db2ab1b758e0ce3e3fc960d9d104.webp?t=1759311804\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=342 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROLL THE DICE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and reroll unwanted dice to chase ever more valuable hands. Strategically pace your rerolls or go all in chasing the ultimate hand to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/41c7ce311d87013b2055e36e1f7608eb.poster.avif?t=1759311804\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/41c7ce311d87013b2055e36e1f7608eb.webm?t=1759311804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/41c7ce311d87013b2055e36e1f7608eb.mp4?t=1759311804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A DECK OF SKULLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose skulls to add to your deck and find new opportunities to increase your score. Experiment, find synergies, and try different playstyles. Construct a deck of skulls to turn even the worst hand of dice around, or pick skulls that reward risky play and pushing your luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/72290c4a07b23b33aaa2a10c1c7bb0d7.poster.avif?t=1759311804\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/72290c4a07b23b33aaa2a10c1c7bb0d7.webm?t=1759311804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY HANDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate as many skulls as possible with every hand and use your rerolls to gain every advantage you can. Upgrade chosen hands to increase their value and complement your deck of skulls to meet increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/79eb0bb843d451f69f1599ba859c19c1.poster.avif?t=1759311804\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/79eb0bb843d451f69f1599ba859c19c1.webm?t=1759311804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/79eb0bb843d451f69f1599ba859c19c1.mp4?t=1759311804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAIL AND TRY AGAIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run out of hands, it is game over for you. Don\u2019t worry, though. Persistence is rewarded, and the guardian of the Underworld seems to grow fond of you coming back to challenge him for just one more round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/184180f6a572ab7cb1b51418cc3fb41e.poster.avif?t=1759311804\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/184180f6a572ab7cb1b51418cc3fb41e.webm?t=1759311804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/184180f6a572ab7cb1b51418cc3fb41e.mp4?t=1759311804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053920?t=1759311804","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/0d94498c3fecc21c8b74c83639ae62acae234eee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759311804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/73b5d6a289bbbf97ebe230ea6b03c34933068127/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759311804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/73b5d6a289bbbf97ebe230ea6b03c34933068127/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759311804","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice of Kalma is a  deckbuilding roguelike where you play dice against Kalma, the grim guardian of the Underworld. Build a deck of powerful skulls, find synergies, and turn the dice to your favor to escape back to the world of the living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO