_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/184180f6a572ab7cb1b51418cc3fb41e.poster.avif?t=1759311804\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/184180f6a572ab7cb1b51418cc3fb41e.webm?t=1759311804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/extras/184180f6a572ab7cb1b51418cc3fb41e.mp4?t=1759311804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Pepperbox Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3885520","name":"Dice of Kalma"},"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053920/95a010766a6a07bbdbaba001327455eb66d0bf42/header.jpg?t=1759311804","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4053920/2063646682/002bed8465bdaa4e64aed9e549b337f16b433894/1758785554/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758786304","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4053920/2063646682/002bed8465bdaa4e64aed9e549b337f16b433894/1758785554/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758786304","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4053920/2063646682/002bed8465bdaa4e64aed9e549b337f16b433894/1758785554/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758786304","id":257204521,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204521/movie480.mp4?t=1758786304","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204521/movie_max.mp4?t=1758786304"},"name":"Dice of Kalma Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204521/95fd8101efb607e6630aaddbf94f2ce4d2f34845/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758786304","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204521/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758786304","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204521/movie_max_vp9